    body: 'Handwritten <b>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</b> and <b>React</b> where a builder is the wrong tool, plus WordPress migrations, WordPress to Astro work, and automating repetitive maintenance.',
    features: ['JavaScript & React', 'WordPress → Astro migration', 'Automation of repeat work'],
    note: 'Where I keep growing',
